      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's okay to feel like you're losing yourself; sometimes the world just feels too big and the old version of you is too tired to keep going. You don't have to force yourself to be the person you were yesterday, especially when the path ahead looks so uncertain. It's not your fault that the light is dimming, and there is no shame in pausing until you feel a spark return.",
