    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if i don't want to wait for a spark? the struggle to keep the lights on just feels so heavy. everything is so loud and exhausting and i keep trying to find that person i was, but there's nothing left. sometimes i think the darkness would actually just be... quieter. more peaceful than trying to force a light that isn't there anymore.",
